      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "The Yangtze-as-gold-mine image is retained in H076."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H076",
      "decision": "BASE",
      "reason": "SOL changes supplies moving back and forth into supplies moving only along the river."
